{
  "title": "QuickSight / Quick Sight · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "데이터를 연결해 시각화하고 대시보드로 공유하는 AWS의 비즈니스 인텔Region스(BI) 기능이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>QuickSight / Quick Sight</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#amazon-quick-and-quick-sight\">Amazon Quick and Quick Sight</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Sources and Datasets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#spice\">SPICE</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#direct-query\">Direct Query</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#refresh-schedules-and-incremental-refresh\">Refresh Schedules and Incremental Refresh</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-preparation-and-calculated-fields\">Data Preparation and Calculated Fields</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analyses, Sheets and Visuals</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboards and Sharing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">Row-level and Column-level Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#private-vpc-connections-and-permissions\">Private VPC Connections and Permissions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#embedded-analytics\">Embedded Analytics</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#natural-language-and-related-services\">Natural Language and Related Services</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>분석</span><span>37 / 62</span></div><h1>QuickSight / Quick Sight</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 12 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon Quick Sight는 데이터를 시각화하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a>로 공유하는 BI 기능이다. 기존 Amazon QuickSight는 현재 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#amazon-quick-and-quick-sight\">Amazon Quick</a> 안의 Quick Sight로 이어지며 기존 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>·SDK·Integration은 계속 지원된다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a> 연결 → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a> 준비 → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a> 작성 → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a> 게시 순서로 이해한다. Athena는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>의 SQL Query, Redshift는 Data Warehouse, Quick Sight는 분석 결과의 시각화·공유 역할에 초점이 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Import 분석과 원본 조회\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Import 분석과 원본 조회</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>SPICE</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>·Athena·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>·Redshift</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>SPICE <span class=\"full-name\">(Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a></strong><small>Import·예약 Refresh</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a> → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a></strong><small>빠른 반복 시각화</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Direct Query</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a></strong><small>원본 Database</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Query on interaction</strong><small>원본 성능·부하 영향</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a> → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a></strong><small>조회 시점 데이터</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">RLS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">CLS</a>로 데이터 접근을 제한하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a>를 Reader에게 공유한다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\">Role</th><th scope=\"col\">Data freshness</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a></td><td>연결·접근 설정</td><td>원본에 종속</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a></td><td>분석 데이터 구조</td><td>Mode에 종속</td></tr><tr><td>SPICE <span class=\"full-name\">(Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine)</span></td><td>Import Copy / 빠른 분석</td><td>Refresh 시점</td></tr><tr><td>Direct Query</td><td>원본 조회</td><td>Query 시점</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a></td><td>편집 작업 공간</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a>에 종속</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a></td><td>게시·공유 화면</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a>에 종속</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"amazon-quick-and-quick-sight\"><h2>Amazon Quick and Quick Sight<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#amazon-quick-and-quick-sight\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#amazon-quick-and-quick-sight\">Amazon Quick</a>은 Quick Sight 외에 Flows·Automate·Index·Research·Apps 등 기능을 포함한다. 기존 QuickSight의 BI 내용은 Quick Sight에서 학습한다. 과거 자료의 QuickSight와 현재 문서의 이름을 연결해서 이해한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"data-sources-and-datasets\"><h2>Data Sources and Datasets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>·Athena·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>·Redshift 등 연결 설정이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a>은 분석할 Table·Field·전처리의 논리 집합이다. Credential·Network·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 권한이 맞아야 데이터를 읽을 수 있다. 한 Source에서 여러 목적의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a>을 만들 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"spice\"><h2>SPICE <span class=\"full-name\">(Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#spice\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine에 데이터를 Import하여 빠르게 분석한다. 반복 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a> 조회 때 원본 Query 부하를 줄일 수 있다. 원본 변경을 반영하려면 Refresh가 필요하고 Capacity·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a> 한도를 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"direct-query\"><h2>Direct Query<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#direct-query\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 원본에 Query하여 최신 데이터에 접근한다. Import Copy 없이 원본 성능·Network·접근 권한의 영향을 받는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a> 동시 사용자가 늘면 Database Query 부하도 커질 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"refresh-schedules-and-incremental-refresh\"><h2>Refresh Schedules and Incremental Refresh<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#refresh-schedules-and-incremental-refresh\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>SPICE <span class=\"full-name\">(Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine)</span>는 Manual·Scheduled Refresh와 지원 Incremental Refresh를 구성한다. 증분 범위·시간 필드·원본 변경 패턴에 맞게 설정한다. Refresh 실패·지연을 모니터링해야 사용자가 오래된 자료를 최신으로 오해하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"data-preparation-and-calculated-fields\"><h2>Data Preparation and Calculated Fields<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-preparation-and-calculated-fields\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>필드 Type·Join·Filter·Calculated Field로 분석 구조를 준비한다. Join Cardinality와 Aggregation 수준을 잘못 잡으면 합계가 중복될 수 있다. 원본 ETL·Data Quality 검증과 시각화 계산의 역할을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"analyses-sheets-and-visuals\"><h2>Analyses, Sheets and Visuals<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a>는 작성자가 Chart·Filter·Parameter·계산을 편집하는 작업 공간이다. 여러 Sheet와 Table·Bar·Line·KPI 등 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Visual</a>을 구성한다. 지표의 집계 방식·단위·Filter 적용 범위를 명확히 표시한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dashboards-and-sharing\"><h2>Dashboards and Sharing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a>로 게시해 Reader와 공유한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Analysis</a> 편집 권한과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a> 열람 권한은 다르다. 게시 뒤 변경사항 반영·사용자·Group 접근을 관리한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"row-level-and-column-level-security\"><h2>Row-level and Column-level Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-4\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 4\">[4]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">RLS</a>는 사용자·Group·지원 Tag 조건에 따라 Row를 제한한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">CLS</a>는 민감한 Column의 접근을 제한한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a>·Edition·Embedding 방식별 지원 조건을 확인하고 화면 Filter를 보안 정책 대신 사용하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"private-vpc-connections-and-permissions\"><h2>Private VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Connections and Permissions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#private-vpc-connections-and-permissions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a>에는 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> Connection과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·Route·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>가 필요하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">IAM Role</a>·Resource Permission·DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Credential을 각각 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a> 공유 권한이 원본의 모든 접근 권한을 자동 부여하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"embedded-analytics\"><h2>Embedded Analytics<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#embedded-analytics\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>앱에 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">Visual</a>·지원 Authoring 경험을 삽입할 수 있다. Registered·Anonymous Embedding의 Session·Domain·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">RLS</a> 조건과 비용을 비교한다. Tenant 분리는 앱 URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span> Parameter만으로 보장하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"natural-language-and-related-services\"><h2>Natural Language and Related Services<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#natural-language-and-related-services\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 Natural Language·Generative BI 기능은 데이터 기반 질문·설명을 돕는다. Semantic 정보·권한·데이터 품질이 결과에 영향을 준다. Glue의 Catalog·ETL, Athena Query, Redshift Warehouse와 BI Layer를 구분한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Log를 Glue Catalog와 Athena로 집계하고 Quick Sight SPICE <span class=\"full-name\">(Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Dataset</a>을 예약 갱신한다. 부서별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">RLS</a>를 적용하여 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a>에서도 각 부서의 Row만 보이게 한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>집계·시각화·공유는 Quick Sight, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 데이터를 SQL로 조회하는 것은 Athena, 데이터 웨어하우스는 Redshift에 가깝다. SPICE <span class=\"full-name\">(Super-fast, Parallel, In-memory Calculation Engine)</span>는 원본 변경 사항을 반영하려면 새로 고침이 필요하다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/what-is.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">quick/latest/userguide/what-is.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/quick-bi.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">quick/latest/userguide/quick-bi.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/spice.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">quick/latest/userguide/spice.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/restrict-access-to-a-data-set-using-row-level-security.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">quick/latest/userguide/restrict-access-to-a-data-set-using-row-level-security.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q104/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q104\" data-question=\"Q104\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q104</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q104/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company stores sales data in Amazon S3 and uses Amazon Athena to query it. Business analysts need interactive charts and dashboards that they can share with executives. Which AWS capability should they use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Quick Sight (formerly Amazon QuickSight)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · Athena로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 데이터를 조회하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Quick Sight</a>에서 이를 시각화해 대시보드를 게시·공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q105\" data-question=\"Q105\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q105</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q105/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A frequently viewed dashboard queries an RDS data source. The company wants faster visualizations and fewer repeated queries against the source database. Which Quick Sight dataset mode is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS Snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q105\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS FIFO</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 데이터를 메모리 기반 엔진에 가져와 반복적인 분석 쿼리를 빠르게 처리한다. 원본의 변경 사항은 데이터 세트 새로 고침으로 반영한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q106\" data-question=\"Q106\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q106</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q106/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A Quick Sight dashboard must query the underlying database when viewers open or interact with it, rather than rely on a periodically refreshed imported copy. Which dataset mode should the architect select?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Direct Query</a>는 대시보드를 사용할 때 원본 데이터 소스를 조회한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 가져온 데이터의 새로 고침이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q107\" data-question=\"Q107\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q107</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q107/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An analyst has finished creating charts in a Quick Sight analysis and wants to give business users a shared, interactive view without granting them permission to edit the analysis. What should the analyst publish?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Amazon Machine Image</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A dashboard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q107\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 분석(<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">analysis</a>)을 대시보드로 게시해 사용자 또는 그룹에 공유한다. 대시보드 열람자는 필터 등으로 상호작용할 수 있지만 원본 분석을 직접 편집하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q108\" data-question=\"Q108\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q108</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q108/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company shares the same Quick Sight dashboard with regional managers, but each manager must see only the rows for their own region. Which feature meets this requirement?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q108\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q108\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q108\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Row-level security (RLS) on the dataset</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q108\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 placement groups</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Quick Sight</a>의 행 수준 보안(<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">RLS</a>)은 데이터 세트에서 사용자 또는 그룹에 따라 보이는 행을 제한한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">이전 용어 <b>Placement Group</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">다음 용어 <b>RDS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
